{"id":1547,"title":"数组广播","summary":"什么是广播？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"18a44ce2-1efd-357e-8be3-983bc26879c7","knowledge_id":288,"title":"什么是广播？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":288,"title":"什么是广播？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"52fdba2d-342e-3a67-935a-b9dcc4e9b08e","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在 NumPy 中，我们可以对**不同维度**的数组执行数学运算。\n\n一个维度较小的数组会被扩展，以匹配较大数组的维度。这就是**广播**。\n\n假设我两个不同维度的数组:","text_html":"<p>在 NumPy 中，我们可以对<strong>不同维度</strong>的数组执行数学运算。</p>\n<p>一个维度较小的数组会被扩展，以匹配较大数组的维度。这就是<strong>广播</strong>。</p>\n<p>假设我两个不同维度的数组:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4e3846fd-dd74-3dbd-8cf3-99cb2f476f4d","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"array1 = [0, 2, 4]\narray2 = [[6], [8], [4]]","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a72d35d9-0e78-3d42-a330-634d7f57eeeb","title":"","title_html":"","text":"现在，尝试在这两个不同维度的数组之间执行加法运算。","text_html":"<p>现在，尝试在这两个不同维度的数组之间执行加法运算。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dbfd0b70-a4c1-37e3-8f03-4cfb3b8577e8","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"result = array1 + array2","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f39668de-eb0f-364a-b2a5-9f66b6854655","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里，NumPy 会自动广播一维数组 `array1` 的大小，以便与二维数组 `array2` 执行逐元素相加。","text_html":"<p>在这里，NumPy 会自动广播一维数组 <code>array1</code> 的大小，以便与二维数组 <code>array2</code> 执行逐元素相加。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0c1ea793-6c7a-3cd3-8987-a4c622bbb0ae","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"import numpy as np\n\narray1 = np.array([0, 2, 4])\narray2 = np.array([[6], [8], [4]])\n\n# 将不同维度的数组相加\n# array1的大小扩展以与array2匹配\nresult = array1 + array2\n\nprint(result)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ea0b0cb5-e424-3e6f-bce4-8a2444e8dc71","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**输出**\n\n```text\n[[ 6  8 10]\n [ 8 10 12]\n [ 4  6  8]]\n```\n\n在这里，我们对两个不同维度的数组执行了加法运算。","text_html":"<p><strong>输出</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">[[ 6  8 10]\n [ 8 10 12]\n [ 4  6  8]]\n</code></pre>\n<p>在这里，我们对两个不同维度的数组执行了加法运算。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"70e26bec-d914-39bd-88e5-70da088dc0e2","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/b5c8e553626e13d3fc36.png","style":"original","caption":"NumPy Broadcasting","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":628,"size_in_bytes":19841,"name":"numpy-5.3.1.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1669fd96-ab64-3bf7-ab3c-02c1f92bb50a","title":"","title_html":"","text":"NumPy 会自动扩展一维数组 `array1` 的大小，使其与二维数组 `array2` 的大小相匹配。\n\n就像广播一样，第一个数组在行上被复制，以获得与第二个数组相同的行数。\n同样，第二个数组的列数与第一个数组的列数相同。","text_html":"<p>NumPy 会自动扩展一维数组 <code>array1</code> 的大小，使其与二维数组 <code>array2</code> 的大小相匹配。</p>\n<p>就像广播一样，第一个数组在行上被复制，以获得与第二个数组相同的行数。\n同样，第二个数组的列数与第一个数组的列数相同。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":8},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"852e5c1e-010d-33b0-be6c-67e13e1d2ccb","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/f2d67679c77f87e02aa6.png","style":"original","caption":"Expanding Arrays for NumPy Broadcasting","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":694,"size_in_bytes":33565,"name":"numpy-5.3.2.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":9},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c902217b-d6d8-3ea2-98d6-3deea81bd77d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"然后，在两个二维数组之间进行逐元素加法运算。","text_html":"<p>然后，在两个二维数组之间进行逐元素加法运算。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":10},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"526314e1-768d-3285-97f7-c8f37f6a1aa4","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/5deccd207d07f5a1050a.png","style":"original","caption":"Addition After NumPy Broadcasting","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":608,"size_in_bytes":23661,"name":"numpy-5.3.3.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":11},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"65881656-4567-3bcd-90d9-33148353d1b1","title":"","title_html":"","text":"NumPy 定义了一些规则，以确定数组是否可沿维度广播。\n\n现在我们来讨论一下广播的兼容性规则。","text_html":"<p>NumPy 定义了一些规则，以确定数组是否可沿维度广播。</p>\n<p>现在我们来讨论一下广播的兼容性规则。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":12}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e5ba38e9-c5f0-3b71-af58-f4f11e35ba78","knowledge_id":289,"title":"广播兼容性规则","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":289,"title":"广播兼容性规则","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"91e73a51-cec1-3c1e-8fcd-fd12ea663987","title":"","title_html":"","text":"NumPy 定义了一些规则，用于确定数组是否可沿维度广播。\n\n广播只适用于兼容数组。NumPy **从右向左**比较一组数组的维度。\n每一组维度都必须与数组兼容才能广播。在检查两个数组的兼容性时，我们会**从右向左**比较它们的维度。\n\n当出现以下情况时，一组维度是兼容的：\n\n- 其中一个长度为 **1**\n- 它们相等\n\n来看一个例子：","text_html":"<p>NumPy 定义了一些规则，用于确定数组是否可沿维度广播。</p>\n<p>广播只适用于兼容数组。NumPy <strong>从右向左</strong>比较一组数组的维度。\n每一组维度都必须与数组兼容才能广播。在检查两个数组的兼容性时，我们会<strong>从右向左</strong>比较它们的维度。</p>\n<p>当出现以下情况时，一组维度是兼容的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>其中一个长度为 <strong>1</strong></li>\n<li>它们相等</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来看一个例子：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"951fab11-85dc-3dce-badf-5646d1215419","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"array1 = shape(6, 7)\narray2 = shape(6, 1)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8bb8dd71-2a17-3481-a130-f21d6d9c5cff","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里，`array1` 和 `array2` 分别是维数为`(6,7)` 和 `(6,1)`的数组。\n`array1` 的最右边维度是 **7**，`array2`的最右边维度是 **1**。由于其中一个的长度为 **1**，因此它们是兼容的。\n\n来看看左边的维度，**6**和**6**是兼容的，因为它们是相同的。\n由于两组维数是兼容的，因此数组是可广播的。\n\n现在，让我们来看看可广播和不可广播维度的数组。\n\n**可广播维度**：\n\n- `(6,7)`和`(6,7)`由于形状相同，因此它们彼此兼容。\n\n- `(6,7)`和`(6,1)`由于第二个数组的最后（右侧）维度是 **1**，因此可以沿第二个维度复制，以匹配第一个数组的列数。\n\n- `(6,7)`和`(7,)`。\n\n在这种情况下，第二个数组的维度为 `(7,)`，可以沿第一个轴复制 6 次，得到形状为 `(6,7)`的数组，从而使两个数组兼容。\n\n两个数组不需要有相同的维数就可以广播。\n\n**不可广播的维度**\n\n- `(6，7)`和`(7，6)`。\n- `(6,7)`和`(6,)`。\n\n最后一组维度是不可广播的，因为 `(6, )` 在填充一个数字后会得到 `(1,6)`，这与 `(6,7)`不兼容。","text_html":"<p>在这里，<code>array1</code> 和 <code>array2</code> 分别是维数为<code>(6,7)</code> 和 <code>(6,1)</code>的数组。\n<code>array1</code> 的最右边维度是 <strong>7</strong>，<code>array2</code>的最右边维度是 <strong>1</strong>。由于其中一个的长度为 <strong>1</strong>，因此它们是兼容的。</p>\n<p>来看看左边的维度，<strong>6</strong>和<strong>6</strong>是兼容的，因为它们是相同的。\n由于两组维数是兼容的，因此数组是可广播的。</p>\n<p>现在，让我们来看看可广播和不可广播维度的数组。</p>\n<p><strong>可广播维度</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code>(6,7)</code>和<code>(6,7)</code>由于形状相同，因此它们彼此兼容。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>(6,7)</code>和<code>(6,1)</code>由于第二个数组的最后（右侧）维度是 <strong>1</strong>，因此可以沿第二个维度复制，以匹配第一个数组的列数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>(6,7)</code>和<code>(7,)</code>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在这种情况下，第二个数组的维度为 <code>(7,)</code>，可以沿第一个轴复制 6 次，得到形状为 <code>(6,7)</code>的数组，从而使两个数组兼容。</p>\n<p>两个数组不需要有相同的维数就可以广播。</p>\n<p><strong>不可广播的维度</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>(6，7)</code>和<code>(7，6)</code>。</li>\n<li><code>(6,7)</code>和<code>(6,)</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后一组维度是不可广播的，因为 <code>(6, )</code> 在填充一个数字后会得到 <code>(1,6)</code>，这与 <code>(6,7)</code>不兼容。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b8db584f-d114-36f6-851b-56f334ae8f83","title":"NumPy 广播","question_id":3177,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"question_id":3177,"title":"NumPy 广播","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"在 NumPy 中，什么是广播？","question_text_html":"<p>在 NumPy 中，什么是广播？</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11133,"key":"A","text":"打印数组元素的方法","text_html":"<p>打印数组元素的方法</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"广播不是用来打印数组元素的。","md_html":"<p>广播不是用来打印数组元素的。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11134,"key":"B","text":"对不同维度的数组执行操作的方法。","text_html":"<p>对不同维度的数组执行操作的方法。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"广播会隐式地扩展较小数组的维度，使其与较大数组的维度相匹配，从而可以对不同维度的数组执行操作。","md_html":"<p>广播会隐式地扩展较小数组的维度，使其与较大数组的维度相匹配，从而可以对不同维度的数组执行操作。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11135,"key":"C","text":"在数组中复制元素的方法","text_html":"<p>在数组中复制元素的方法</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"广播不是主要用来复制数组元素的。","md_html":"<p>广播不是主要用来复制数组元素的。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11136,"key":"D","text":"将数组转换为不同数据类型的方法","text_html":"<p>将数组转换为不同数据类型的方法</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"广播不涉及更改数组中任何元素的数据类型。","md_html":"<p>广播不涉及更改数组中任何元素的数据类型。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d7c5294c-31c3-38be-ae25-4f05b0bd42ae","title":"NumPy 广播兼容性","question_id":3178,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"question_id":3178,"title":"NumPy 广播兼容性","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下哪种数组维度与用于广播的`(4, 3)`数组不兼容？","question_text_html":"<p>以下哪种数组维度与用于广播的<code>(4, 3)</code>数组不兼容？</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11137,"key":"A","text":"(4, 1)","text_html":"<p>(4, 1)</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`(6,1)`中的右侧维度为 **1**，因此与`(4, 3)`兼容。","md_html":"<p><code>(6,1)</code>中的右侧维度为 <strong>1</strong>，因此与<code>(4, 3)</code>兼容。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11138,"key":"B","text":"(4,3)","text_html":"<p>(4,3)</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`(4,3)`与`(4,3)`兼容。它不需要广播。","md_html":"<p><code>(4,3)</code>与<code>(4,3)</code>兼容。它不需要广播。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11139,"key":"C","text":"(3,)","text_html":"<p>(3,)</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`(3,)`与`(4,3)`是兼容的。","md_html":"<p><code>(3,)</code>与<code>(4,3)</code>是兼容的。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11140,"key":"D","text":"(4,5)","text_html":"<p>(4,5)</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`(4,5)`与`(4,3)`不兼容，因为第二个维度不匹配。","md_html":"<p><code>(4,5)</code>与<code>(4,3)</code>不兼容，因为第二个维度不匹配。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"91922623-6ef9-3d9d-a997-df92365448f6","knowledge_id":290,"title":"标量广播","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":290,"title":"标量广播","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"850c303d-d36b-3a50-847b-ceea4f4beb3d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"当使用数组操作标量（比方说单个数值）时，会根据数组的维度进行广播。\n\n例如，`np.array([1, 2, 3] * 2`与`np.array([1, 2, 3]) * np.array([2, 2, 2])`的行为相同，其中 **2** 与第一个数组的每个元素相乘。\n\n一个简单的理解方式是，NumPy 会展开标量以创建相同维度和大小的数组。","text_html":"<p>当使用数组操作标量（比方说单个数值）时，会根据数组的维度进行广播。</p>\n<p>例如，<code>np.array([1, 2, 3] * 2</code>与<code>np.array([1, 2, 3]) * np.array([2, 2, 2])</code>的行为相同，其中 <strong>2</strong> 与第一个数组的每个元素相乘。</p>\n<p>一个简单的理解方式是，NumPy 会展开标量以创建相同维度和大小的数组。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d9d35893-f0c6-349a-8836-58859c616bc5","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/c2fda667d20b54fa781f.png","style":"original","caption":"NumPy Scalar Broadcasting","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":462,"size_in_bytes":18747,"name":"numpy-5.3.4.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f70112d4-bcb9-3fdd-b53d-cafcc1770e5e","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"import numpy as np\n\n# 一维数组\narray1 = np.array([1, 2, 3])\n\n# 标量\nnumber = 5\n\n# 添加标量和一维数组\nsum = array1 + number\n\nprint(sum)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1fdaf644-2c55-3f01-896d-2194f9b6d8a2","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**输出**\n\n```text\n[6 7 8]\n```\n\n\n在这个例子中，NumPy 自动将标量 `number` 扩展为一维数组，然后执行元素相加。\n\n在下一课中，我们将学习NumPy中的通用函数和失量化操作。","text_html":"<p><strong>输出</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">[6 7 8]\n</code></pre>\n<p>在这个例子中，NumPy 自动将标量 <code>number</code> 扩展为一维数组，然后执行元素相加。</p>\n<p>在下一课中，我们将学习NumPy中的通用函数和失量化操作。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":3}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"034","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/034/page/1547"}
